			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"玉霞"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701020102,
					"content": "關於這枚「牙齒」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701020103,
					"content": "牙齒？請給我看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玉霞"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020104,
					"content": "唔…這種形狀和尺寸，確實有些不同尋常。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玉霞"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020105,
					"content": "我對這類材料並不是太瞭解…但烏爾班為了鍛造武器經手過許多材料，也許他會知道些什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玉霞"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020106,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}可以去問問他，他就在旁邊，很容易就能找到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "玉霞"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7010202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7010207
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7010207",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7010207,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7010206",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7010206,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"烏爾班"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701020201,
					"content": "關於這枚「牙齒」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701020202,
					"content": "#牙齒？什麼牙齒，{F#妳}{M#你}是在雪山上面撿到了什麼亂七八糟的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020203,
					"content": "咦？這枚牙齒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020204,
					"content": "怎，怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701020205,
					"content": "這枚牙齒的質地，看起來很不錯，韌性也很足…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020206,
					"content": "還有這個斷面…簡直就像是「龍牙」嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020207,
					"content": "龍牙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701020208,
					"content": "就是龍的牙齒。據說用龍牙打造的武器會格外堅硬鋒利…而且還會有奇異的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020209,
					"content": "不過，龍牙可不是能隨便撿到的東西，傳說裡那些取得了龍牙，並且用龍牙鍛造出武器的人，本身都是赫赫有名的大英雄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020210,
					"content": "哈哈哈，就像那句話說的，如果手上沒有能夠擊敗巨龍的武器，又怎麼能擊敗巨龍拿到龍牙呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020211,
					"content": "那這枚「牙齒」是龍牙嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701020212,
					"content": "說實話，我沒有經手過龍牙這種材料，也沒法下判斷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020213,
					"content": "我是覺得，這枚「牙齒」大概是什麼巨獸的牙齒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020214,
					"content": "#但既然{F#妳}{M#你}費了這麼大功夫把這枚「牙齒」拿過來，我們就權當它是一枚珍貴的「龍牙」好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020215,
					"content": "唔…但這一枚應該不夠打造武器。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020216,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}再去搜集大概…三枚這樣的「牙齒」過來吧，我也會去查一下資料，看看處理它們的方法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020217,
					"content": "對了，除了這些<color=#00E1FFFF>「牙齒」</color>之外，還得弄些好礦石來輔助…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020218,
					"content": "#唔，{F#妳}{M#你}去雪山上的時候，順便再採五十份<color=#00E1FFFF>「星銀礦石」</color>來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020220,
					"content": "除了這些之外…我還需要一把<color=#00E1FFFF>「北陸長柄武器原胚」</color>…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701020219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				},
				{
					"id": 701020219,
					"content": "#把這些東西搜集好了之後，{F#妳}{M#你}就都拿來給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "烏爾班"
				}
			]
